trainiac-via
============

A VIA Rail (Canada) coverage area for the Trainiac /v1 API. This project's own
code is offered under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

Contract
--------
src/v1.d.ts and openapi.v1.json are copied unchanged from
https://github.com/trainiac-hq/docs so that this adapter conforms to the
published Trainiac /v1 contract. They remain the property of the Trainiac
project and are included here only to validate compatibility.

Data
----
Live and scheduled data is retrieved at runtime from VIA Rail Canada's open
feeds:

  * Live tracker:  https://tsimobile.viarail.ca/data/allData.json
  * GTFS schedule: https://www.viarail.ca/sites/all/files/gtfs/viarail.zip

